# LLAISYS Implementation Report

## Overview

The required LLAISYS implementation has been completed, including:

* CPU backend
* NVIDIA CUDA backend
* MetaX backend
* Required operators:

  * add
  * argmax
  * embedding
  * linear
  * rms_norm
  * rope
  * self_attention
  * swiglu
* FP32 / FP16 / BF16 support where applicable
* Qwen2 / DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B inference
* KV Cache
* Python bindings and device selection

The implementation has been reproduced on CPU, NVIDIA GPU, and MetaX GPU.

